        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a clerk in this new FPS (First Person Scanning) game by picking up groceries, rotating them to find the barcode, and scanning them. The game offers a lot of different challenges such as a scale, lottery tickets, postal service, and much more! With a wide variety of maps in different areas and biomes, this is unlike anything you've ever played before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's your job as a clerk to give the customers the correct groceries and throw away the bad and moldy ones. The faster you complete a level's goal, the more stars you'll get, and you need the stars to continue making progress in the game. If you want to get 100% of the game, you'll have to try hard, but if you're more of a casual gamer, you can take your time and enjoy the music, atmosphere, and the satisfying sound of the scanner: <strong>BEEP!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than just a simulation game! This game offers a new way to play this genre with innovative mechanics and an inspiring art style. The game uses physics in a lot of different ways to create both a realistic feeling and a completely new way of thinking. So, sit down, pick up the groceries, and <strong>ScanIt!</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a clerk in this new FPS (First Person Scanning) game by picking up groceries, rotating them to find the barcode, and scanning them. The game offers a lot of different challenges such as a scale, lottery tickets, postal service, and much more! With a wide variety of maps in different areas and biomes, this is unlike anything you've ever played before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's your job as a clerk to give the customers the correct groceries and throw away the bad and moldy ones. The faster you complete a level's goal, the more stars you'll get, and you need the stars to continue making progress in the game. If you want to get 100% of the game, you'll have to try hard, but if you're more of a casual gamer, you can take your time and enjoy the music, atmosphere, and the satisfying sound of the scanner: <strong>BEEP!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than just a simulation game! This game offers a new way to play this genre with innovative mechanics and an inspiring art style. The game uses physics in a lot of different ways to create both a realistic feeling and a completely new way of thinking. So, sit down, pick up the groceries, and <strong>ScanIt!</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "You take on the role of a clerk working at a store, tasked with scanning items for each customer. The game introduces a unique gameplay mechanic that focuses on item manipulation, adding a layer of challenge and engagement and introducing a fresh twist to the simulation genre.",
